{"id":2286,"date":"2024-01-16T19:27:53","date_gmt":"2024-01-16T13:57:53","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.zettafarms.com\/?page_id=2286"},"modified":"2024-02-12T18:33:34","modified_gmt":"2024-02-12T13:03:34","slug":"extension-enablers","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.zettafarms.com\/extension-enablers\/","title":{"rendered":"Extension Enablers"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"2286\" class=\"elementor elementor-2286\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9a8352a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"9a8352a\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2b0c978 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"2b0c978\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"808\" src=\"https:\/\/www.zettafarms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/faqs.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-522\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.zettafarms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/faqs.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/www.zettafarms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/faqs-300x126.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.zettafarms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/faqs-1024x431.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/www.zettafarms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/faqs-768x323.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.zettafarms.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/faqs-1536x646.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a4cbd9a e-flex e-con-boxed elementor-invisible e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"a4cbd9a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f220728 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"f220728\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-86bb391 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"86bb391\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;zoomIn&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Extension Enablers<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b77fd6f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b77fd6f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Individuals interested in partnering with us for farming, expanding their agri-business, or establishing agri-processing units can connect with us through our extension enabler model.<\/p>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ad261c3 e-flex e-con-boxed elementor-invisible e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"ad261c3\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-05d68c5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-accordion\" data-id=\"05d68c5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n        <div class=\"elementskit-accordion accoedion-primary\" id=\"accordion-6aa1d09739038\">\n\n            \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card active\">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-0-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-fec06d56aa1d09739038\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-fec06d56aa1d09739038\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-fec06d56aa1d09739038\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What are the minimum requirements?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-fec06d56aa1d09739038\" class=\" show collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-0-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa1d09739038\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>1. Land Area: At least 100 acres, can be in multiple patches within 2 to 3 km.<br \/>2. Proper Irrigation system<br \/>3. Fencing around the farm<br \/>4. Electricity connection<br \/>5. Road Connectivity to the Farm<br \/>6. Storage and Stay facility<br \/><br \/>These requirements may be adjusted based on geographical locations.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-1-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-16033686aa1d09739038\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-16033686aa1d09739038\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-16033686aa1d09739038\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Can you help us cultivate high-value crops different from traditional crops in that area?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-16033686aa1d09739038\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-1-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa1d09739038\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>If possible, yes, but it depends on the soil cond<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-2-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-468c54a6aa1d09739038\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-468c54a6aa1d09739038\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-468c54a6aa1d09739038\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What technologies will you deploy different from traditional methods?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-468c54a6aa1d09739038\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-2-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa1d09739038\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>We prefer precision farming, involving scientifically calculated methods to reduce the risk of soil degradation.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-3-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-17901786aa1d09739038\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-17901786aa1d09739038\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-17901786aa1d09739038\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">With the help of Zetta Farms, how much additional percentage of yield can we expect from the same land?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-17901786aa1d09739038\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-3-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa1d09739038\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>We always try to get the maximum output without damaging the soil<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-4-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-e5fa05d6aa1d09739038\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-e5fa05d6aa1d09739038\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-e5fa05d6aa1d09739038\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Who will be responsible for the market connect<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-e5fa05d6aa1d09739038\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-4-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa1d09739038\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>Both parties will conduct due diligence, and the party with the best offer will be considered.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-5-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-20e39766aa1d09739038\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-20e39766aa1d09739038\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-20e39766aa1d09739038\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">What if the partner is getting better rates for produce compared to Zetta?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-20e39766aa1d09739038\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-5-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa1d09739038\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>The best offer will be considered<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-6-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-23dee776aa1d09739038\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-23dee776aa1d09739038\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-23dee776aa1d09739038\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Who will be responsible for the field operations<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-23dee776aa1d09739038\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-6-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa1d09739038\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>Zetta Farm will take care of agronomy support, fund management, and market connections.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-7-05d68c5\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-8196af06aa1d09739038\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-8196af06aa1d09739038\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-8196af06aa1d09739038\">\n                            \n                            <span class=\"ekit-accordion-title\">Who will bear the cost of agronomists (Field Officers and Farm Supervisor) in the field?<\/span>\n\n                            \n                                <div class=\"ekit_accordion_icon_group\">\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_normal_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Normal Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-down-arrow1\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"ekit_accordion_active_icon\">\n                                        <!-- Active Icon -->\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<i class=\"icon icon-up-arrow\"><\/i>                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n\n                            \n                                                    <\/a>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <div id=\"Collapse-8196af06aa1d09739038\" class=\" collapse\" aria-labelledby=\"primaryHeading-7-05d68c5\" data-parent=\"#accordion-6aa1d09739038\">\n\n                        <div class=\"elementskit-card-body ekit-accordion--content\">\n                            <p>This cost will be included in farm expenses.<\/p>                        <\/div>\n\n                    <\/div>\n\n                <\/div><!-- .elementskit-card END -->\n\n                                        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Extension Enablers Individuals interested in partnering with us for farming, expanding their agri-business, or establishing agri-processing units can connect with us through our extension enabler model. What are the minimum requirements? 1. Land Area: At least 100 acres, can be in multiple patches within 2 to 3 km.2. Proper Irrigation system3. Fencing around the farm4. [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"inline_featured_image":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-2286","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Extension Enablers - ZETTA FARM<\/title>\n<meta name=\"r